1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,270
Milo: Ellie! Ellie! Wake up, sleepy elephant.

2
00:00:06,795 --> 00:00:07,777
Ellie: Good morning, Milo!

3
00:00:08,302 --> 00:00:10,403
Milo: Good morning, Ellie! What a sunny day.

4
00:00:10,928 --> 00:00:12,370
Ellie: Shall we go and play in the meadow?

5
00:00:12,895 --> 00:00:14,607
Ellie: The meadow is full of friends today.

6
00:00:15,219 --> 00:00:17,306
Milo: Yes please! Let's go.

7
00:00:18,181 --> 00:00:20,858
Milo: Wait. Listen, Ellie. Do you hear that?

8
00:00:23,196 --> 00:00:24,042
Milo: What was that?

9
00:00:24,567 --> 00:00:26,660
Ellie: I don't know. Let's go and find out!

10
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:29,983
Bella: Moo! Moo! Good morning, friends!

11
00:00:30,508 --> 00:00:32,551
Ellie: Look, Milo. It is Bella the cow.

12
00:00:33,076 --> 00:00:35,244
Ellie: Bella lives here in the big green field.

13
00:00:35,769 --> 00:00:37,967
Milo: Hello Bella! What sound do you make?

14
00:00:38,492 --> 00:00:40,283
Bella: I say moo! Moo! Moo!

15
00:00:40,983 --> 00:00:42,143
Milo: Can you say moo with me?

16
00:00:44,893 --> 00:00:46,671
Bella: Would you like to hear it one more time?

17
00:00:47,108 --> 00:00:47,892
Bella: Moo! Moo!

18
00:00:48,592 --> 00:00:50,509
Milo: Moo! Moo! That was wonderful.

19
00:00:52,671 --> 00:00:54,663
Milo: Ellie, look! Down by the pond.

20
00:00:55,188 --> 00:00:57,656
Pip: Quack! Quack! Hello everyone!

21
00:00:58,181 --> 00:01:00,436
Ellie: That is Pip the duck. Pip loves to swim.

22
00:01:00,961 --> 00:01:03,133
Pip: Come and see my lovely blue pond!

23
00:01:03,658 --> 00:01:05,457
Milo: Pip, what sound do you make?

24
00:01:05,982 --> 00:01:08,055
Pip: I say quack! Quack, quack!

25
00:01:08,580 --> 00:01:09,456
Ellie: Can you say quack?

26
00:01:12,206 --> 00:01:14,356
Pip: Quack! Quack! Very good!

27
00:01:16,491 --> 00:01:17,830
Milo: Oh! Who said that?

28
00:01:18,355 --> 00:01:20,419
Hop: Ribbit! Down here, on the lily pad!

29
00:01:20,944 --> 00:01:23,326
Ellie: Hello Hop! Hop is a little green frog.

30
00:01:23,851 --> 00:01:25,996
Hop: I say ribbit! And I love to jump.

31
00:01:26,521 --> 00:01:28,154
Ellie: Frogs are wonderful jumpers.

32
00:01:28,679 --> 00:01:30,691
Hop: Watch me go. Hop, hop, hop!

33
00:01:31,304 --> 00:01:32,857
Milo: Can you jump and say ribbit?

34
00:01:35,607 --> 00:01:37,324
Hop: Ribbit! Ribbit! Hooray!

35
00:01:40,037 --> 00:01:42,518
Milo: Oh my! That was a very big sound.

36
00:01:43,043 --> 00:01:45,430
Leo: Roar! Hello there. My name is Leo.

37
00:01:45,955 --> 00:01:48,703
Ellie: Do not worry, Milo. Leo is a friendly lion.

38
00:01:49,228 --> 00:01:51,336
Leo: I say roar! But I am very gentle.

39
00:01:51,861 --> 00:01:53,240
Milo: Can you roar like Leo?

40
00:01:53,590 --> 00:01:55,089
Leo: Would you like to try a big roar?

41
00:01:57,839 --> 00:01:59,404
Leo: Roar! What a brave sound!

42
00:02:00,454 --> 00:02:02,248
Ellie: Let us all make our sounds together!

43
00:02:02,861 --> 00:02:04,625
Milo: One, two, three... everybody!

44
00:02:05,150 --> 00:02:05,425
Bella: Moo!

45
00:02:05,687 --> 00:02:06,095
Pip: Quack!

46
00:02:06,358 --> 00:02:06,845
Hop: Ribbit!

47
00:02:07,108 --> 00:02:07,523
Leo: Roar!

48
00:02:07,786 --> 00:02:09,724
Milo: Squeak, squeak!

49
00:02:10,161 --> 00:02:12,011
Ellie: And the elephant says toot, toot!

50
00:02:14,736 --> 00:02:16,417
Ellie: Thank you for playing with us today.

51
00:02:16,942 --> 00:02:18,973
Ellie: You did so well today. Well done!

52
00:02:19,585 --> 00:02:21,685
Milo: Come back soon. Goodbye, friends!

53
00:02:22,210 --> 00:02:23,163
Bye bye!

